{"version":1,"content":"<p>金像影后廖子妤（Fish）昨日（28日）突然網晒患胃痙攣，原來是太為食之故，她表示晚餐吃了兩個冰淇淋、一個熟透的柿子，消夜再吃炸雞塊和汽水：「結果睡前經歷非常難受的胃痙攣，痛得打滾一邊大喊『我知錯了』。</p><p>」Fish表示自小經常胃痛不適，不吃會</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:21:13.107034+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:55:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:16.330788+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:16.330788+00:00","content_hash":"7fc453ac2af8a02176df942ed2dd4fa882a48c1be440e9c9ceb28a4bec7ff78b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}